WEBVTT

00:00:00.167 --> 00:00:02.861
Film it again. See your progress.

00:00:03.300 --> 00:00:07.015
Open any lift in Bar Trace. Scroll down to the breakdown.

00:00:07.467 --> 00:00:10.811
It sets this lift against your last lifts at a similar weight.

00:00:11.267 --> 00:00:17.304
You see turnover time, peak speed and bar drift. Each one says what changed.

00:00:17.767 --> 00:00:21.854
Download Barforge Weightlifting. No account. Free to start.
